data: {"id": "972f652a49de4e18-final", "run_id": "972f652a49de4e18", "seq": 1030, "ts_ms": 1789123888917, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | aiops-case-v05/workload Pod 处于 ContainerCreating (Pending) 状态且无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `fact-686a85319db1` | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` | 直接指出卷挂载失败的具体配置缺失原因 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `fact-ab6bdb5dea65` | `Pod phase: Pending` | 确认 Pod 整体处于等待状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `fact-bda26a3128dc` | `Container \"app\" waiting reason: ContainerCreating` | 定位容器卡在此阶段无法启动 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | `fact-07f2a6c697ed` | `container.app resource_limit.memory: 32Mi` | 确认资源限制，排除资源溢出导致的事件 |\n| 5 | Metric | `fact-1ad304d2ea3b` | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1 (reason: ContainerCreating)` | 确认当前等待状态的量化观测 |\n\n**证据分析：**\n事件 `fact-686a85319db1` 明确记录了 `FailedMount` 错误及缺失的 ConfigMap key，这是导致 Pod 无法进入 `Running` 状态的直接技术原因；状态 `fact-bda26a3128dc` 和指标 `fact-1ad304d2ea3b` 一致反映了该等待状态；资源配置 `fact-07f2a6c697ed` 证明资源配额本身未触发 OOM 或限流，排除了计算资源不足的因素。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 缺失 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 尝试挂载卷 'input' 失败 (FailedMount) → Pod 状态持续为 Pending/ContainerCreating → 容器无法启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **配置错误**：Pod 定义中引用的 ConfigMap Volume `input` 包含了一个不存在的 Key `unavailable-key`（事实 `fact-686a85319db1`）。\n\n这一配置错误导致 kubelet 在启动容器前执行卷挂载时失败，进而使 Pod 陷入 `Pending` 且容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态（事实 `fact-ab6bdb5dea65`、`fact-bda26a3128dc`）。由于容器未能启动，未产生任何日志或 Tracing 数据，现象与配置事实高度一致，证据充分。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 37.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 37.5s (Evidence 29.4s, RCA 8.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 63.369, "metrics": {"run_id": "972f652a49de4e18", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 63.374593019485474, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 63374.59301948547, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 60557.94548988342, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 6, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 5936.002016067505, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2364.530324935913}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16803.484439849854, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {